# CollegeFootballData.com API key — free at https://collegefootballdata.com/key
# Powers `npm run build:data` (AP poll weeks 1936+, all-time records/wins, NFL
# draft counts, the trend indicator, the year-over-year note) and
# `npm run logos:sync` (500px full-colour logo set). Without it, build:data falls
# back to data/manual/*.csv and the trend indicator stays flat.
CFBD_API_KEY=
